== request: GET http://app.example.org/api/users?id=3
listener: 127.0.0.1:18081
server: tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:19 [server_name app.example.org] — the first server block wins — server_name/Host selection is parse-only at this pin (a named delta)
location: / (tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:26)
  precedence: = exact > longest prefix (regex is parse-only at this pin and never wins)
  candidate location / (tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:26) — won: the longest matching prefix wins (1 bytes)
  candidate location /health (tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:34) — lost: the path does not start with this prefix
effective directives (the winning chain, with provenance):
  proxy_set_header Host $host;  # from tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:10
  listen 18081;  # from tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:20
  server_name app.example.org;  # from tests/config-corpus/reverse-proxy/nginx.conf:21
